{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：17:27 2026-11-22 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"Anthropic擁2370億美元現金儲備 超越四大科企總和\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6dc39c18f58c06d0563dc6e9732944cf/2026-11/PIC_ONLY_-_2026-02-06T122255_775_0.png\"/>\n<p>研究機構The Kobeissi Letter發文指出，上周剛在美股上市的AI巨頭Anthropic坐擁驚人的巨額儲備，其現金與現金等價物達到創紀錄的2,370億美元。該機構解釋，這主要得益於其IPO成功募集了810億美元，並透過向特定投資者進行的私募配售額外籌得260億美元。</p>\n<img alt=\"研究機構The Kobeissi Letter發文指，Anthropic坐擁驚人的巨額儲備。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a1083c857243446444e986515723a083/2026-11/HXpstwFWgAAbYKt.jpeg\" title=\"研究機構The Kobeissi Letter發文指，Anthropic坐擁驚人的巨額儲備。\"/>\n<p>相比之下，Alphabet、亞馬遜、SpaceX及蘋果各自持有的現金量均不足此金額的25%。換言之，Anthropic的現金儲備比上述4家公司總和還要多。同時，Alphabet的現金儲備也是Nvidia的8倍、微軟的12倍及Meta的22倍。作為參考對照，巴郡現金儲備則高達3,770億美元。<br/> </p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T09:43:51.644684+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":312,"images":2,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T09:27:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T17:37:50.187463+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T09:37:25.367921+00:00","content_hash":"4d18e2fcb1c111196b1beaf03d170954f9f632797fd5bb7380c60b19aa21b039","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}